@ Index:   Extreme-scaled exponential PLOT and SOLVE stress test
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert
@ Created: 2026-07-24
@ Tested:  Returns 1 at x=1e-50 and e (2.71828...) at x=2e-50.
@ Input:   Variable x=1e-50 (also 2e-50)
@ Output:  X = 1 (2e-50 returns e 2.718281828459045235360287471352662)
@
@ Computes e^(MVAR x) at tiny multiples of x in the range of -10E-50 to 10E-50
LBL ‘FFX’
  MVAR ‘x’
  RCL ‘x’
  1.e-50
  -
  1.e+50
  ×
  𝑒ˣ
  END
.END.
